class.description:
A [PerformanceBudgetResult] is returned by [method PerformanceBudget.check_summary] and [method PerformanceRecorder.check_budget]. It passes if no rule failed. In automated runs (test project, CI, [code]--quit-after[/code]), end the run with [method get_exit_code]:
[codeblocks]
[gdscript]
var result = PerformanceRecorder.check_budget(load("res://perf/budget.tres"))
for failure in result.get_failures():
	printerr(failure.get_message())
get_tree().quit(result.get_exit_code())
[/gdscript]
[csharp]
var result = PerformanceRecorder.CheckBudget(GD.Load<PerformanceBudget>("res://perf/budget.tres"));
foreach (var failure in result.GetFailures())
{
	GD.PrintErr(failure.GetMessage());
}
GetTree().Quit(result.GetExitCode());
[/csharp]
[/codeblocks]
